WEBVTT

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:30.179
and carve on them.

00:18:31.114 --> 00:18:33.175
On one of them, carve:

00:18:33.199 --> 00:18:35.420
"Problems are soluble."

00:18:35.763 --> 00:18:37.888
And on the other one, carve:

00:18:37.912 --> 00:18:39.865
"Problems are inevitable."

00:18:40.444 --> 00:18:41.602
Thank you.

00:18:41.626 --> 00:18:42.729
(Applause)